<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$60.0 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$60.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian commercial paper market absorbed a total of A$60 million worth of promissory notes via tenders on Thursday.</p>
<p>The issuers, General Property Trust and McDonald's Corp, sold A$30 million each.</p>
<p>At 0030 GMT (11.30 a.m.) June 90-day bank bill futures were down two points to 94.02.</p>
